flowchart LR
  A[Innovation<br/>Pratique émergente] --> B[Habitualisation<br/>Routinisation]
  B --> C[Objectivation]
  C --> D{Légitimation}
  D --> E[Piliers régulatif<br/>normatif<br/>culturel-cognitif]
  E --> F[Sédimentation<br/>Naturalisation]
  F --> G[Taken for granted]

  class A,B,C etape
  class D seuil
  class E pilier
  class F,G ancre
  classDef etape  fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#1E2A23,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#1E2A23
  classDef seuil  fill:#FBF3DE,stroke:#8A6D1F,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#1E2A23
  classDef pilier fill:#EAEDE6,stroke:#5A685F,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#1E2A23
  classDef ancre  fill:#E3EFE6,stroke:#127552,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#1E2A23
